    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nNo. 52 Clonuske Drive presents a superb opportunity to acquire a beautifully maintained two-bedroom mid-terrace residence, thoughtfully enhanced with a spacious attic conversion. This inviting home is presented in excellent condition throughout, offering a warm and contemporary interior that is ready for immediate occupation.\nUpon entering, you are welcomed by a bright and generously proportioned living room to the front, providing an ideal setting for relaxation. To the rear, a stylish and newly fitted kitchen/dining area forms the heart of the home, perfectly designed for both everyday living and entertaining, with direct access to the private rear garden.\nUpstairs, the property boasts two large double bedrooms, each complete with built-in wardrobes, offering ample storage and comfort. The attic conversion further enhances the property, providing a versatile space suitable for a home office, or additional living area subject to planning permission.\nExternally, the property enjoys a private rear garden featuring a wooden deck, a covered pergola ideal for outdoor dining, and a barna shed for additional storage. To the front, convenient parking bays are available for residents and visitors alike.\nIdeally positioned in a quiet cul-de-sac and overlooking a large green area, this home is perfectly suited as a starter property or for those seeking a peaceful yet well-connected setting. The location is second to none, with a host of amenities nearby including shops, schools, the beach, and Balbriggan train station, ensuring excellent connectivity.\nFurther benefits include gas-fired central heating and double-glazed PVC windows, enhancing comfort and energy efficiency throughout. This is a truly impressive home that combines style, space, and location in equal measure."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 1.35m x 1.1m\nwith tiled flooring and door to living room\n\nLiving Room - 5.4m x 4.28m\nwith wood flooring, feature fireplace & backing, door to understair storage cupboard\n\nKitchen Dining Room - 4.65m x 3.95m\nwith tiled flooring and good range of upgraded modern wood presses, drawers & worktops, plumbed for washing machine and dishwasher, built-in hob.\n\nGuest WC - 1.75m x 1.2m\nwith tiled flooring, press units under WHB, WC.\n\nBedroom One - 3.45m x 4.28m\nwith laminate flooring & built in wardrobes.\n\nBedroom Two - 2.88m x 3.77m\nwith laminate flooring & built in wardrobes.\n\nBathroom - 1.46m x 2.86\nfully tiled bathroom with bath with electric shower over and glass screen, whb with vanity unit and mirror, door to hotpress.\n\nAttic room - \nwith carpet flooring and velux windows\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Superb 2 bed mid terrace house with large attic conversion</li><li>Excellent condition throughout</li><li>Large living accommodation with Living room to front</li><li>Separate kitchen diner to the rear with new kitchen units</li><li>Two large double bedrooms with built in wardrobes</li><li>Ideal Starter home located in quiet cul de sac and adjacent large green area</li><li>Parking bays to the front of the property</li><li>Gas fired central heating & Upgraded double-glazed PVC windows</li><li>Private rear garden with wooden deck area, covered pergola and barna shed</li><li>Close to all amenities including shops, beach, train station, schools.</ul>"
      },
